B.Wv=new A.dh(0,15,"Welcome to Greyfriars Kirkyard, one of the most storied and atmospheric churchyards in Scotland.")
B.Ws=new A.dh(15,32,"Founded in 1562 under Mary Queen of Scots, this ground holds the remains of over 100,000 souls.")
B.Wl=new A.dh(32,52,"Throughout the centuries, Greyfriars witnessed religious wars, grave-robbing resurrection men, and supernatural legends.")
