B.GQ=new A.hn("Battle of Dunbar (1650)","Fought between Oliver Cromwell's English forces and the Scottish Covenanter army. Despite being outnumbered, Cromwell achieved a decisive victory, leading to the English occupation of southern Scotland. This was a major blow to Scottish independence during the Wars of the Three Kingdoms.")
