B.GU=new A.hn("Battle of Prestonpans (1745)","The first major battle of the 1745 Jacobite Rising, fought just east of Edinburgh. Bonnie Prince Charlie's Highland army routed the government forces in less than fifteen minutes, in one of the most stunning victories in Scottish military history.")
